      "id": "choose-where-to-begin",
      "title": "Choose where to begin",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The User Guide covers day-to-day work after Cove is running: browsing and playing media, finding things quickly, organizing content, managing metadata workflows, controlling access, and keeping the installation healthy."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "assets/user-guide-overview.png",
          "alt": "Cove User Guide with a searchable topic list and a shared article",
          "caption": "On desktop, browse every topic in the sidebar or narrow the list with search. On mobile, focus the search field to browse the same formatted topic list."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "For a new installation, begin with Get Started instead. It connects the supported installation paths, shared first-run setup, first scan, and introductory library tutorials."
        },
        {
          "type": "links",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "Get Started",
              "href": "/docs/get-started/"
            },
            {
              "label": "Your first hour with Cove",
              "href": "/docs/tutorial/",
              "topicId": "getting-started"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
